@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Chat: question with an answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Qual é o SLA para incidentes P1 no plano Enterprise?"
}

### Chat: with debug (query plan, retrieved chunks, selected chunks)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Qual é o SLA para incidentes P1 no plano Enterprise?",
  "debug": true
}

### Chat: without reranking
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Quais formas de pagamento o FCAI Cloud aceita?",
  "use_rerank": false,
  "debug": true
}

### Chat: ambiguous question (returns needs_clarification=true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Como funciona o suporte no plano da empresa?"
}

### Chat: answer not in the knowledge base
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Qual é a capital da França?"
}

### Chat: empty question (returns 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "   "
}

### Chat: missing field (returns 422, validated by FastAPI/Pydantic)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "debug": true
}

### Chat: wrong method (returns 405, /chat only accepts POST)
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat

### Interactive API docs (Swagger UI, generated by FastAPI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

### API docs (ReDoc, generated by FastAPI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/redoc

### OpenAPI schema (generated by FastAPI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json

### Swagger UI OAuth redirect (auxiliary route generated by FastAPI, only used by Swagger UI auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/oauth2-redirect
